# MD92 ride from Untamed's state 8 (Rocksbury Free Ride, at rest at the gate): openmx-mods' drive.pad
# (gas 9 s, which flew the first lip and wrecked on a later landing), then wait out the put-back, then
# steer left and right, brake, gas, coast.
down cross
sleep 270t
release
sleep 180t
down cross
sleep 30t
stick l -1 0
sleep 30t
stick l 0 0
sleep 20t
stick l 1 0
sleep 30t
stick l 0 0
sleep 20t
up cross
down square
sleep 30t
up square
down cross
sleep 30t
release
sleep 30t
